Attribution
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

TiDLoad is a derivative work. It was written from scratch for this repository, but
its download flow follows the approach of the "Song Downloader" plugin from
Inrixia/luna-plugins (https://github.com/Inrixia/luna-plugins), which is also
licensed AGPL-3.0. Credit for the original plugin, the TidaLuna plugin API and the
build tooling (luna-template, https://github.com/Inrixia/luna-template) belongs to
Inrixia and the TidaLuna contributors.

TiDLoad does not talk to Tidal directly. It drives the TidaLuna client API
(@luna/core, @luna/lib, @luna/ui) running inside the TIDAL desktop app, and it only
downloads content the signed-in user can already stream.
